@* Feature 142 — Describe stage canvas (guided AI on-ramp). *@
@* The persistent AI chat pane (in the shell, left) drives the build; this canvas shows the *@
@* service taking shape as a plain-language journey. US4 (T045) enriches the live-build *@
@* interaction; the journey projection itself is shared with the Understand stage. *@

@namespace Sorcha.UI.Web.Client.Pages.DesignerShell.Stages
@using MudBlazor
@using Sorcha.UI.Core.Components.Designer

<div class="designer-stage designer-stage--describe" data-testid="stage-describe">
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="designer-stage__hint mb-2">
        Describe your service in the chat on the left. It takes shape here as a journey — who does
        what, in order — so you can see it forming as you go.
    </MudText>
    <JourneyView />
</div>
